      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not quite sure if that is feasible -- The `java_api_contribution` modules passed as `al.properties.Api_contributions` are being [dynamically created inside `droidstubs`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/java/droidstubs.go;drc\u003df8aaaa13f4fb87cc0f7bd5231f2334499d174109;l\u003d187), which happens before `GenerateAndroidBuildActions` where `checkCurrentApiTimestamp` is initialized. Thus I cannot think of a way to pass the file via provider when the module is being created. Please let me know if there is a way to do so.",
